---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import ProgramCard from '../../components/ProgramCard.astro';
import { CORE_SERVICES } from '../../data/services';
import { PROGRAMS } from '../../data/highlights';
import { BUSINESS, telHref, absoluteUrl } from '../../data/site';
import { localBusinessSchema, BUSINESS_ID } from '../../utils/schema';

const crumbs = [{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Services', href: '/services/' }];
const catalog = {
  '@type': 'OfferCatalog',
  name: 'Autism therapy services',
  url: absoluteUrl('/services/'),
  itemListElement: CORE_SERVICES.map((s) => ({
    '@type': 'Offer',
    itemOffered: { '@type': 'Service', name: s.name, url: absoluteUrl(`/services/${s.slug}/`), provider: { '@id': BUSINESS_ID } },
  })),
};
---
<PageLayout
  title="Autism Therapy Services in Westminster, CA"
  description="Applied Behavior Analysis (ABA), speech and language therapy, and occupational therapy for children with autism in Westminster, CA and surrounding counties."
  h1="Our Autism Therapy Services"
  eyebrow="Our programs"
  lead="Three core therapies that work together to support communication, social development, independence and behavioral growth."
  crumbs={crumbs}
  schema={[localBusinessSchema(), catalog]}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        {PROGRAMS.map((p) => <ProgramCard {...p} />)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>How our autism therapy services fit together</h2>
      <p>Most families start with in-home ABA therapy, our flagship service, and add speech and language therapy, occupational therapy or parent training as their child's needs become clear. Every program is designed and supervised by Board Certified Behavior Analysts (BCBAs) and delivered with Registered Behavior Technicians (RBTs), with parent training included. The plan is individualized to your child and your family's routines.</p>
      <p>Each service below has its own page with more detail. You do not need to choose a single service at the start. A consultation helps you decide which combination fits your child.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Our services in more detail</h2>
      {CORE_SERVICES.map((s) => (
        <div class="mt-2">
          <h3><a href={`/services/${s.slug}/`}>{s.name}</a></h3>
          <p>{s.description}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Who our services are for</h2>
      <p>Our services are for children with autism and their families. Our center is at {BUSINESS.address.street} in {BUSINESS.address.city}, {BUSINESS.address.region}, where center-based ABA takes place. In-home ABA therapy is available across five California counties: Orange, Riverside, San Diego, San Bernardino and Santa Clara. We are launching in-home services in Orange County first, so availability in the other four counties may depend on your address. <a href="/locations/">See our service area</a>, or call <a href={telHref}>{BUSINESS.phone}</a> to confirm availability.</p>
      <p>School-based ABA support is offered in classrooms across Orange County, helping children practice learning, social and routine skills with teachers and peers.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Insurance and coverage</h2>
      <p>Many insurance plans, including Medi-Cal, cover ABA therapy for children with an autism diagnosis. Coverage varies by plan, so please check with your plan. Our team can help you understand coverage and the authorization process. Read more on our <a href="/insurance/">insurance page</a> and in our guide to <a href="/blog/does-medi-cal-cover-aba-therapy/">whether Medi-Cal covers ABA therapy</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>How to get started</h2>
      <p>Start with a free consultation. Call <a href={telHref}>{BUSINESS.phone}</a> or send a message through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. We will talk with you about your child's strengths, needs and goals, and help you decide which service is the right starting point. Before you choose a provider, our guide to <a href="/blog/how-to-choose-an-aba-provider/">questions to ask ABA providers</a> can help you compare options.</p>
      <p>Talk with your child's pediatrician about developmental concerns and specific medical needs. They know your child's history and can help you plan evaluations alongside therapy.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
